#: resource-bar@ticko4.github.io/prefs.js:415
msgid "Color thresholds"
msgstr "Prahové hodnoty farieb"

#: resource-bar@ticko4.github.io/prefs.js:416
msgid ""
"Below the activity threshold a metric uses the normal top bar color. Between "
"activity and critical it moves toward the alert color, and at critical it is "
"fully that color."
msgstr ""
"Pod prahom aktivity má metrika bežnú farbu hornej lišty. Medzi prahom "
"aktivity a kritickým prahom sa postupne mení na farbu upozornenia a pri "
"kritickom prahu má úplne túto farbu."

#: resource-bar@ticko4.github.io/prefs.js:444
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "Aktivita"

#: resource-bar@ticko4.github.io/prefs.js:445
msgid "Critical"
